creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Healing\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Healing <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Witch%20Temple\">Ice Witch Temple</a>, second floor, in the centre when <a href=\"#/wiki/Zushuka\">Zushuka</a> has spawned.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tFrost Spiders chase their opponent and try to obstruct them from defeating their master, <a href=\"#/wiki/Zushuka\">Zushuka</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tThere is no reason to kill Frost Spiders unless they are blocking your path to the ice pillar or the altar. You must kill <a href=\"#/wiki/Zushuka\">Zushuka</a> to stop the Frost Spiders from spawning. You can use <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Wall%20Rune\">Energy Wall Runes</a> to stop the Frost Spiders from blocking you while you destroy the pillars. For more, see the strategy of <a href=\"#/wiki/Zushuka\">Zushuka</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h